        "TileImage": "$($repository b7f20ccf-01c2-4e48-8dc7-946747769629).Image",
        "Description": "April 29, 2011, Bratislava, Slovakia. Good afternoon 47, your targets are now Kent Wakefield and Ted Montgomery. Eliminate both targets with Fire Axe and hide their bodies in the box. After you eliminate both targets, meet with Mária Pietrová at RTVS headquaters (Radio and Television of Slovakia) to test powerplay on camera. Good luck 47!\rSources:\rhttps://www.facebook.com/MY-SME-TU-DOMA-MS-v-hokeji-na-STV-115298825220027/photos/116647981751778",
